Construction Drones - Meketreve flavor

The MIT license in LICENSE covers the changes made in this fork, which are listed in the Credits section of
readme.md.

The mod this fork is based on was written by Klonan, forked by roy192, repackaged for Factorio 2.0 by Tubbles and
rewritten and updated for Factorio 2.1 by daz96050:

    https://github.com/Klonan/Construction_Drones
    https://github.com/Tubbles/Construction_Drones
    https://github.com/daz96050/Construction_Drones

None of those are published with a license, so those parts of the code, along with the graphics and the sounds,
stay under the rights of their authors. Licensing the whole mod under MIT would need their permission.
